                "help": "The sequence information for this deposition will be released according the value of this item. Setting this status code to \"RELEASE NOW\" indicates that the macromolecular sequence(s) for this entry may be displayed in PDB status reports prior to the release of the entry. The PDB will release your sequence data after the annotated entry is sent to the contact author and a reply is received, or after 3 weeks from the date the wwPDB IDcode is issued. Setting this status code to \"HOLD FOR RELEASE\" conceals the sequence information in PDB status reports until the coordinate data for this entry are released.",
